# First battleground session this job has ever run. carried save, touch,
# priest:shadow, flee, conquest map -- the whole mode is unexplored so this
# starts at the front page rather than jumping in on a hash, since there is
# no invite shortcut into a battleground to jump to.
open
targets
ui
shot front

tap battleground
targets
ui
shot bgsetup

tap map:conquest
targets
ui
shot classpick

tap class:priest:shadow
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
targets
shot pulled

play flee 180
bill
says
state
shot after180
targets

# Something no session has done before: pick The Long Haul (escort) and leave
# without pulling, then come back, to see whether the mode is remembered the
# way conquest and flags are.
open
tap battleground
tap map:escort
targets
state
shot escort-picked

open
targets
state
shot after-reload
